ea in H K  Labeled  left axillary lymph node dissection  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is dissected to reveal multiple lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 2 0cm in greatest dimension  with soft to fatty cut surfaces  Submitted in L Q  Resident  STAMATINA KAPTAIN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY   EXCISION   report_end  , Unknown.
